# Scan-only product surface (current ship)

`lib/core/product_surface.dart` → **`kScanOnlySurface = true`**.

## What users see

- Shell: **Home · Scan FAB · Me** only
- Flows: Scan → Review → Export → Library → Viewer
- Home: search · All / Favorites / **Tagged** / Deleted · scan docs
- Me: appearance · themes · trash · tags · About (100% offline footer)
- Onboarding: 3 short pages (Welcome · Tags&themes · Ready)

## Hidden (code stays — do not re-surface unless flag flipped)

Convert hub · Edit photo · PDF Tools · QR · Shortcuts strip · inner nav slots · Replay tutorial · convert Open-with actions (gated to viewer)

## Agent rules

1. Design, copy, tests, Play/App Store answers, and “what’s left” assume **scanner app**, not toolkit.
2. Do **not** add UI entry points to converters/QR/PDF Tools while flag is true.
3. User-facing strings: no Convert / QR / Edit photo / Shortcuts / Replay unless restoring full toolkit.
4. Release smoke P0 = Scan → Save PDF → reopen. Converter/Open-with tool E2E is **not** ship-blocking while scan-only.
5. Flip `kScanOnlySurface` to `false` only when user asks to bring toolkit back.
